                        "rule": "Splitting Middle Term",
                        "formula": "Find p, q such that p+q=b, pq=ac",
                        "example": "$x^2-5x+6=0 \\Rightarrow p=-2, q=-3 \\Rightarrow (x-2)(x-3)=0$."
